--no-checkout` of the Secuura checkout + `checkout --detach d7e95cd9f` (script file `clone.sh`, 12:17:49-12:17:52), in
`/private/tmp/claude-501/night/s17f_1156/clone`, farmed and shared-built by `tasks/code_patch/prepare_clone.sh` (rc 0,
12:19:22). Scripts there: `runvt.sh` (per-cell json summary, `vitest run --root`, no cd), `tampers.py` / `tampers2.py`
(anchor count 1 asserted, project tsc per row, restore by pristine bytes with `git hash-object` asserted == `18946cd7c`).
**Every vitest run and the checker ran inside `sandbox-exec` with off-host outbound denied and loopback allowed**
