- **P1 tip.** origin develop = `d7e95cd9f153e9036ed77935a73c93504fa6e3dc` (`git ls-remote origin develop` from the Secuura checkout 12:14:05-12:14:08; `cat-file -t` = commit; `build_input.sh`'s own ls-remote at 12:19). Clone HEAD equal. The anonymous https ls-remote answered `Repository not found` (private repo), so the ssh origin was the instrument.
